data: {"id": "7ba9277cf27e4436-thinking-parallel_evidence-1974", "run_id": "7ba9277cf27e4436", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "让我基于已有工具结果整理证据，并针对关键歧义进行补充调查。\n\n**已有关键事实：**\n- `kubectl_get_yaml` 显示：`deletionTimestamp: 2026-09-14T06:51:29Z`，`deletionGracePeriodSeconds: 3900`，`finalizers: <none>`，`phase: Running`\n- `kubectl_describe` 显示：`status: Terminating`，但 `lasts: <invalid>`（时间异常）\n- Pod 运行在 node2 上，无 finalizers，但 phase 为 Running 且处于 Terminating 状态\n\n这里有一个**关键矛盾**：YAML 显示 `phase: Running` 但 describe 显示 `status: Terminating`，且 `deletionTimestamp` 已设置但 `finalizers: <none>`。这暗示 Pod 对象可能已被 kube-apiserver 标记为删除但 kubelet 或 garbag", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1789364926807, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

